            "notes": "Round 2 is where I start building for AP since I can do decent damage with [Major Flex](item_f54587d0-45d9-4cf8-993f-49819767f924) or with [Volskaya Vortex](item_4a24240a-a0b1-4a0e-83d1-acf8c5647b5b)\n\n[Major Flex](item_f54587d0-45d9-4cf8-993f-49819767f924) and [Containment Shield](item_0406217c-a6af-4a19-8c7d-052c4d402848) work great together to hunt down low opponents when the time arises.\n\nBooster Jets along with [Major Flex](item_f54587d0-45d9-4cf8-993f-49819767f924) and [Containment Shield](item_0406217c-a6af-4a19-8c7d-052c4d402848) is really good to create space. the downside of less damage is not a big problem since you can reach your opponents much easier or disengage more effectively. This is really good against rein if he's trying to rush you (from my experience)",
